    "detailed_description": "Start practicing your evil laugh! You are a villain heck-bent on conquering the world. Rob banks, fight godlike heroes, and command a horde of henchmen! Romance an intrepid reporter, your partner-in-crime, your biggest fan, or even your archenemy!<br><br><i>Top Villain: Total Domination</i> is a 175,000-word interactive novel by Brandon Greer. It's entirely text-based, without graphics or sound effects, and fueled by the vast, unstoppable power of your imagination.<br><br>In this speculative fiction crime game, you can:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Build a superweapon to hold the world hostage.<br></li><li> Outwit amazing heroes and other villains.<br></li><li> Resolve a henchman strike.<br></li><li> Play as non-binary, female, or male.<br></li><li> Play as gay, straight, omnisexual, pansexual, or asexual.<br></li><li> Attend a fan convention for villains.<br></li><li> Choose where your secret lair is located.<br></li><li> Navigate the complex relationship you have with your parents.</li></ul><br>With your powers, smarts, and good looks, who can stand in your way?",
